stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Post state machine
  [*] --> draft
  draft --> published : publish / after_transition → NotifySubscribersJob
  published --> archived : archive
  archived --> published : restore / guard: user.admin?
  published --> draft : unpublish
  archived --> [*]
  note right of published
    after_transition enqueues
    NotifySubscribersJob (no retry_on ⚑)
  end note
